{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50224","headline":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 帘鈎 · 樊铸","name":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 帘鈎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"成器屈虽深，君门幸许临。\n卷时怀劲节，舒後抱虚心。\n就曲全□保，能刚□匪侵。\n倚身当尽力，不欲负工金。\n（[一]原作物咏，依刘校互乙。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"樊铸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}